ssets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/a4845b2fe6a41c0b8c7ff30c4cf5ebec.avif?t=1750088605\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RADICAL CARS</h2>Build up your points as you race to unlock an array of customisable cars. The cooler your ride, the faster you'll tear through Retropolis. Cruise the neon-lit streets in style!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/d92d07740e49a4de495cadce24b08b44.poster.avif?t=1750088605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/d92d07740e49a4de495cadce24b08b44.webm?t=1750088605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/d92d07740e49a4de495cadce24b08b44.mp4?t=1750088605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/cfcdf7f8db4e32267614c5169efd01d9.avif?t=1750088605\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SYNTHWAVE LEGENDS</h2>Immerse yourself in the synthwave universe with an unforgettable soundtrack featuring artists like:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New Arcades<br></li><li>Neon Nox<br></li><li>Fantom '87<br></li><li>Michael Oakley<br></li><li>Sunglasses Kid<br></li><li>and many more</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/97c0fe6ee27a774108781f5ff98f6751.poster.avif?t=1750088605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/97c0fe6ee27a774108781f5ff98f6751.webm?t=1750088605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/97c0fe6ee27a774108781f5ff98f6751.mp4?t=1750088605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/b789ddcea69bde1cde17ae15f22ec2be.avif?t=1750088605\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Get your '80s vibes in full throttle with Retro Drive! Immerse yourself in the retro aesthetic, gripping narrative, and an unforgettable synthwave soundtrack.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Spanish - Spain, German, French, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil",
    "reviews": "\u201cyou\u2019ll find yourself going for one more go. You press restart, and try again. Because there is something strangely addictive, or hypnotising, about Retro Drive Revamped\u2026\u201d<br>TheSixAxis<br><br>\u201cThere was a precise retrofuturistic vision for the look and feel of this game, and I think the developers realised that vision stupidly well.\u201d<br>BestNerdLife<br>",
